{{!
    @template local_evalia/portfolio_stats

    Exam count and average of the student shown in the portfolio detail.

    Rendered from amd/src/evalia_teacher.js with core/templates; every value is escaped.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * examslabel - "N exams" text
    * averagelabel - "Average: X" text

    Example context (json):
    {
        "examslabel": "2 exams",
        "averagelabel": "Average: 7.5"
    }

    @copyright  2026 Schaller & Ponce <dev@schaller-ponce.com.ar>
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later
}}
<span class="fw-semibold me-3"><span aria-hidden="true">📝</span> {{examslabel}}</span>
<span class="fw-semibold text-primary">{{averagelabel}}</span>
